# Source material, not used by the site: the originals in media-src/ and the
# sound pack. `npm run media` turns them into the small web-ready files in
# src/assets, which are committed. Keep a copy of these folders yourself:
# without them the media can't be regenerated.
media-src/
Persona 3 Reload SFX/

